  },
  {
    "sha": "c80db48a00e709ddc5951be8a0ac51b8b17b02a0",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOSQDBP9oAKGM4MGRiNDhhMDBlNzA5ZGRjNTk1MWJlOGEwYWM1MWI4YjE3YjAyYTA",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Luca Chang",
        "email": "131398524+LucaButBoring@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-09-30T22:21:25Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-09-30T22:21:25Z"
      },
      "message": "ci: publish directly via the release.yml trusted publisher (#29)\n\nThe npm-publish.yml trusted publisher only allows `npm stage publish`, and\napproving staged versions requires an npm maintainer with 2FA. The package\nalso has a release.yml trusted publisher that allows `npm publish`, so rename\nthe workflow to match it and revert #27:\n\n- Rename .github/workflows/npm-publish.yml to release.yml.\n- Publish with `npm publish` again (npm 11.5.1 pin) instead of staging.\n- Restore the verify job that waits for npm to serve the version.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "81e0202287637903fb435360f2b5898cd99623fb",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ext-tasks/git/trees/81e0202287637903fb435360f2b5898cd99623fb"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ext-tasks/git/commits/c80db48a00e709ddc5951be8a0ac51b8b17b02a0",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvYtlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzFsQAEVdaRJVyH8mCuCf1F73GxAS\nh/v70hYjXfTzFhdibWHk5gTbJB326qv0YMCF8Ke+0NB/lA7Z3Hx1H/kP8FJCqfz8\nX8WccukQutMfH3aSUVWI7UPU2TpfMqwJDo5j66bAahOWU2a4axutWY0yWfr97ypv\n+saQIcLOu1Ur7IphNyc11eiKlih42o/fTlcACYFz9rGdzCeT1ewj7DFidFx06cDQ\nF6RKBi4WiMwUb6h9ESjQHesp3hQ1mz72eoM5byvCLLS4u2RiS6UYeL1DkjuoGYcz\nk0bNDwYcoRXT/fgpiF+znWxZ5FBxKZw1r5ehhmvdvZ0cTEk6L/+HDIflnltH1+x+\nEoVhliHZQoM/SzScq/pUVJDrQ5c+nZJ1FETRd6W2xZc+8DQBkBjFZfWqUVOhhxog\nrHRZOtSBMSZve3jVwGuqEM3/blO/lPvdX2aEyS8VQGus5Fsx5BoahPvApkbNCGdg\n9IPHl8I/X4erMI5hxakw7nvmvvibeEEf2oVNYFpWSZ2MO2e+GSWYEuvPAtfl9dXV\nniwEwohHTaJlfgSl4ZPzdSl21ufpnFdFWzwfi/G1MVO3ASU8KcsBD09dwuozB2l7\nJNxGrRNz3Dsnv1zJlBDWMKIjqxEJpXURC1HZ/cHqAuxxdbFEVrn22+QFgRLZk2qi\nmQ+4nvTVqs1CpCmxKk+Y\n=e1CU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 81e0202287637903fb435360f2b5898cd99623fb\nparent 1c7d38bf9c380e7d5a11ed092af588891b2d6f36\nauthor Luca Chang <131398524+LucaButBoring@users.noreply.github.com> 1790806885 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790806885 -0700\n\nci: publish directly via the release.yml trusted publisher (#29)\n\nThe npm-publish.yml trusted publisher only allows `npm stage publish`, and\napproving staged versions requires an npm maintainer with 2FA. The package\nalso has a release.yml trusted publisher that allows `npm publish`, so rename\nthe workflow to match it and revert #27:\n\n- Rename .github/workflows/npm-publish.yml to release.yml.\n- Publish with `npm publish` again (npm 11.5.1 pin) instead of staging.\n- Restore the verify job that waits for npm to serve the version.",
        "verified_at": "2026-09-30T22:21:25Z"
      }
    },
